{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、お風呂を沸かしてるよ～！\n早く沸かないかな～o(｀ω´ )o？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログでね、\n床に入る時間を教えてくれた方が\n多かったんですが、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん案外寝るのが遅くて\nびっくりしました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜更かしばかりは\n身体に悪いので、\nたまには早く寝るように\n私の挑戦を試して見てくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に握手会前やライブ前は\n早く寝るように(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"返事はー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブロードウェイミュージカルの\nイン・ザ・ハイツを\n見に行ってたよー(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブロードウェイミュージカルを\n見るのは初めてだったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声の出し方から、\n表現の仕方から\n手先指先まで全ての神経が\n演技に向けられてて\n圧倒されました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生の舞台は\n編集やカットが出来ないし\n役者さんの呼吸音まで\nしっかり伝わってくるので、\nいつの間にかお話にのめり込んで、\nあっという間にエンディング。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャストさんも素敵な方々で\n本当に楽しかったなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい作品に出会えて\n幸せです！\n他の作品もまた見に行きたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも\nオススメの舞台やミュージカルが\nあったら教えて下さいね(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルも頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n久しぶりにお返事time(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなおにぎりの具は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高菜と鮭が好き(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニのおにぎりは\n100円セールの時は\nいくらとかネギトロとか\nちょっと高級なやつ買います←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\nコンビニおにぎりは\n海苔パリパリ派だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家の手作りおにぎりは\n海苔しなしな派！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、共感してくれる人\nいないかなー(*^o^*)？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなドラマはー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永遠の憧れは\n『やまとなでしこ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵なストーリー。\n松嶋菜々子さんも大好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも最近のじゃないけど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナースのお仕事\nランチの女王\nオレンジデイズ\n白い影\nのだめカンタービレ\nトリック\nアットホームダット\n流星の絆\nアンフェア\nドラゴン桜\nガリレオ\n電車男\nGOOD LUCK!!\n人にやさしく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"など挙げたらキリがない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔からテレビっ子だったから\nドラマはよく見てました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のものは\nあまり見れてないので\n貯まってる録画消化しよーっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少ないですが、\nここまでです(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょくちょくお返事していくので\n聞きたい事がありましたら\nお気軽に聞いて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ジャケ写撮影にて...)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あれ、失敗、、、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からのーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(成功♡♡♡(？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってしまったけど、\nひめたん\n京花\nまあやさん\n設楽さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/04/26/1987486/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い1年になりますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眞衣"}],"source":"archive"}